Description: keyboard-first graphical file manager
 PathPilot combines ranger-style navigation, Vim-inspired keyboard controls,
 tabs, PDF/office/Markdown previews, independent viewer windows, SFTP/SMB,
 an embedded shell terminal and Neovim editing in a native GTK 4 interface.
